    "targeted_window_retired_note": "targeted_window_minutes lived here and asked whoever edited it to remember to keep it equal to the tab routing threshold in scanner/event_lifecycle.py - the same decision, written in two files. It is now event_lifecycle.move_to_today_minutes and nothing else. An older settings.json that still carries the old key is read through scanner/lifecycle_config.py LEGACY_KEYS, but only when the new key is absent, so there is never more than one live answer.",
