    "upcoming_past_grace_minutes": 10,
    "upcoming_past_grace_note": "How long a fixture that has already kicked off may stay on Upcoming. The -15 minute targeted trigger runs every five minutes, so ten leaves room for up to two more attempts after the whistle and no more - however many of those five-minute ticks actually arrive. It was 45, and at 16:14 the owner was looking at a 15:30 match still badged LINK UPDATING - which is not a link being updated, it is a match the feeds never carried. Nothing is lost by dropping it: a fixture that has no link cannot be watched from Upcoming either, and the moment a source does carry a live link the fixture routes straight to Today Match, from the feeds rather than from this file. The hours key above is kept only so an older config still loads.",
